Challenge Daily Summary: <%= @challenge.name %>

Hi <%= @challenge.creator.username %>,

Here's your daily summary for the challenge "<%= @challenge.name %>".

Challenge Details:
- Name: <%= @challenge.name %>
- Start Date: <%= @challenge.start_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %>
- End Date: <%= @challenge.end_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %>
- Timezone: <%= @challenge.timezone %>

Participants (<%= @participants.count %>):
<% if @participants.any? -%>
<% @participants.each do |participant| -%>
- <%= participant.username %> (<%= participant.email %>)
<% end -%>
<% else -%>
No participants have joined yet.
<% end -%>

Thanks,
The And God Said Team

